---
import site from '../data/site.json';
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
---

<section id="tend" class="sec-tend">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tend-text">
      <h2 class="t-h2">My job is telling <span class="serif accent">yours</span> that well.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted tend-p">
        I look after your brand's story so it can take root, reach everyone it's meant for, and become as common as the air we breathe.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="story" class="sec-story">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="ph g-portrait portrait">
      <Photo img={site.portrait} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 90vw, 45vw" />
      <h2 class="t-h2">I started as an artist. <span>I still think like one.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stack">
      <div class="eyebrow rv">About</div>
      <p class="lead rv s2">
        I was on the founding teams at Charlotte's Web and AJNA BioSciences, I serve as interim VP Creative at Igniton, and I run my own studio, 35 FILM.
      </p>
      <p class="t-body rv s3">
        At Charlotte's Web, I was there before there was a brand to market. Before there was a category. I helped shape its story, its message and its look
        from the ground up. I was the entire marketing department until 2016, then built and led the team as the company grew and went public. 13 Clio awards
        later, I still start every project the same way: with the story.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row rv s4"><a href="#work" class="pill dark">See the work</a><a href="#contact" class="pill ghost">Get in touch</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
